#: admin/views/tabs/activity.php:507 admin/views/tabs/events.php:237
#: admin/views/tabs/incidents.php:886
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Réinitialiser"

#: admin/class-admin.php:518
msgid "Disable Hide Login?"
msgstr "Désactiver Hide Login ?"

#: admin/class-admin.php:519
msgid ""
"/wp-login.php will become reachable again at its default location. Your slug"
" is kept so you can re-enable later with one click."
msgstr ""
"/wp-login.php redeviendra accessible à son emplacement par défaut. Votre "
"slug est conservé pour que vous puissiez réactiver plus tard en un clic."

