"frame-ancestors none + form-action self + MIME + Referrer + Permissions-"
"Policy. Safe for 99% of sites."
msgstr ""
"frame-ancestors none + form-action self + MIME + Referrer + Permissions-"
"Policy. Sûr pour 99 % des sites."

#: admin/views/sections/login-headers.php:121
#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:68
msgid "Strict"
msgstr "Stricte"

#: admin/views/sections/login-headers.php:124
msgid ""
"Standard + default-src self, full CSP lockdown. Test before enabling on "
"sites with custom login themes."
msgstr ""
"Standard + default-src self, verrouillage CSP complet. À tester avant "
"activation sur les sites utilisant des thèmes de connexion personnalisés."

#: admin/views/sections/login-headers.php:175
msgid "CSP Report Endpoint (optional)"
msgstr "Point de terminaison de rapport CSP (facultatif)"

#: admin/views/sections/login-headers.php:177
msgid ""
"HTTPS endpoint to receive CSP violation reports. Useful for monitoring "
"attempted injections. Leave blank to skip."
msgstr ""
"Point de terminaison HTTPS pour recevoir les rapports de violations CSP. "
"Utile pour surveiller les tentatives d’injection. Laisser vide pour ignorer."

