#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:38 admin/views/sections/firewall.php:39
msgid ""
"Your server supports .htaccess too, but this PHP filter is portable and "
"every block is logged here."
msgstr ""
"Votre serveur prend aussi en charge le .htaccess, mais ce filtre PHP est "
"portable et chaque blocage est journalisé ici."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:40
msgid ""
"Nginx ignores .htaccess: this PHP-level firewall is the right tool for your "
"stack."
msgstr ""
"Nginx ignore le .htaccess : ce pare-feu au niveau PHP est l’outil adapté à "
"votre environnement."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:41
msgid ""
"On IIS this PHP-level firewall works without any web-server configuration."
msgstr ""
"Sous IIS, ce pare-feu au niveau PHP fonctionne sans aucune configuration du "
"serveur web."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:42
msgid "This firewall runs in PHP, so it works regardless of your web server."
msgstr ""
"Ce pare-feu s’exécute en PHP : il fonctionne quel que soit votre serveur "
"web."

#: includes/class-security-score.php:140 includes/AI/PostureAdvisor.php:207
#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:56 admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:110
#: admin/views/tabs/overview.php:317 admin/views/tabs/settings.php:346
msgid "Request Firewall"
msgstr "Pare-feu de requêtes"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:58
msgid "ENFORCING"
msgstr "BLOCAGE ACTIF"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:60
msgid "MONITORING"
msgstr "SURVEILLANCE"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:66
msgid ""
"Blocks malicious requests in PHP before WordPress processes them: bad query "
"strings, traversal, SQLi/XSS probes, disallowed HTTP methods. Inspired by "
"the 8G firewall."
msgstr ""
"Bloque les requêtes malveillantes en PHP avant que WordPress ne les "
"traite : mauvaises chaînes de requête, traversée de répertoires, sondes "
"SQLi/XSS, méthodes HTTP non autorisées. Inspiré du pare-feu 8G."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:92
msgid "The request firewall is off"
msgstr "Le pare-feu de requêtes est désactivé"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:93
msgid ""
"Common automated probes (SQL injection, traversal, scanner tools) reach "
"WordPress unfiltered. Enabling starts in monitor mode: it logs would-be "
"blocks without blocking anything, so you can review before enforcing."
msgstr ""
"Les sondes automatisées courantes (injection SQL, traversée de répertoires, "
"outils de scan) atteignent WordPress sans filtrage. L’activation démarre en "
"mode surveillance : elle journalise les blocages potentiels sans rien "
"bloquer, afin que vous puissiez les examiner avant de passer en mode "
"blocage."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:102
msgid "Enable Request Firewall (monitor mode)"
msgstr "Activer le pare-feu de requêtes (mode surveillance)"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:116
msgid "firewall matches in the last 30 days."
msgstr "correspondances du pare-feu au cours des 30 derniers jours."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:118
msgid "(Monitor mode: these were logged, not blocked.)"
msgstr "(Mode surveillance : ces requêtes ont été journalisées, pas bloquées.)"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:125
msgid "Mode"
msgstr "Mode"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:127
msgid ""
"Start in Monitor to validate against real traffic. Switch to Enforce only "
"once the monitor log looks clean."
msgstr ""
"Démarrez en mode Surveillance pour valider avec le trafic réel. Passez en "
"mode Blocage uniquement lorsque le journal de surveillance est propre."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:133 admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:112
#: admin/views/tabs/overview.php:323
msgid "Monitor"
msgstr "Surveillance"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:137
msgid ""
"Logs would-be blocks as incidents without blocking. Zero risk of breaking "
"the site."
msgstr ""
"Journalise les blocages potentiels en incidents sans rien bloquer. Aucun "
"risque de casser le site."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:143 admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:113
msgid "Enforce"
msgstr "Blocage"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:146
msgid ""
"Actually blocks matching requests with a 403. Logged-in admins are never "
"filtered."
msgstr ""
"Bloque réellement les requêtes correspondantes avec une erreur 403. Les "
"administrateurs connectés ne sont jamais filtrés."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:156 admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:114
msgid "Conservative rules"
msgstr "Règles conservatrices"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:158
msgid "Very low false-positive risk. Recommended on for everyone."
msgstr "Risque de faux positifs très faible. Recommandé pour tout le monde."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:162
msgid ""
"Block SQL injection, code-exec, traversal and XSS markers in the query "
"string."
msgstr ""
"Bloque l’injection SQL, l’exécution de code, la traversée de répertoires et "
"les marqueurs XSS dans la chaîne de requête."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:163
msgid ""
"Block traversal, sensitive system files, backups and known web-shell paths."
msgstr ""
"Bloque la traversée de répertoires, les fichiers système sensibles, les "
"sauvegardes et les chemins de web-shells connus."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:164
msgid ""
"Allow only standard HTTP methods; block CONNECT, TRACE, TRACK, DEBUG and "
"malformed ones."
msgstr ""
"N’autorise que les méthodes HTTP standard ; bloque CONNECT, TRACE, TRACK, "
"DEBUG et celles qui sont malformées."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:184 admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:115
msgid "Aggressive rules"
msgstr "Règles agressives"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:186
msgid ""
"Higher false-positive risk: these can hit legitimate clients (uptime "
"monitors, Jetpack/XML-RPC, author pages). Enable only if you understand the "
"trade-off, and test in Monitor first."
msgstr ""
"Risque de faux positifs plus élevé : elles peuvent toucher des clients "
"légitimes (moniteurs de disponibilité, Jetpack/XML-RPC, pages d’auteur). "
"N’activez ces règles que si vous en comprenez le compromis, et testez "
"d’abord en mode Surveillance."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:190
msgid ""
"Block scanner and generic HTTP-library user agents (curl, wget, python, "
"sqlmap, nikto…)."
msgstr ""
"Bloque les agents utilisateurs de scanners et de bibliothèques HTTP "
"génériques (curl, wget, python, sqlmap, nikto…)."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:191
msgid ""
"Block requests from known spam referrer domains (best-effort, list ages "
"quickly)."
msgstr ""
"Bloque les requêtes provenant de domaines référents indésirables connus (au "
"mieux, la liste vieillit vite)."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:192
msgid "Block XML-RPC, author enumeration and exposed dev/source files."
msgstr ""
"Bloque XML-RPC, l’énumération des auteurs et les fichiers de "
"développement/source exposés."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:212 admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:116
msgid "Allowlist"
msgstr "Liste d’autorisation"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:214
msgid ""
"Requests from these IPs, or to these paths, are never inspected. One entry "
"per line. IPs accept CIDR ranges (e.g. 203.0.113.0/24). Logged-in "
"administrators are always exempt."
msgstr ""
"Les requêtes provenant de ces adresses IP, ou vers ces chemins, ne sont "
"jamais inspectées. Une entrée par ligne. Les adresses IP acceptent les "
"plages CIDR (par ex. 203.0.113.0/24). Les administrateurs connectés sont "
"toujours exemptés."

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:219
msgid "Allowed IPs"
msgstr "Adresses IP autorisées"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:228
msgid "Use my current IP"
msgstr "Utiliser mon adresse IP actuelle"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:233
msgid "Allowed paths"
msgstr "Chemins autorisés"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:258
msgid "Recent blocks"
msgstr "Blocages récents"

#. translators: %d: number of matched requests
#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:271
msgid "%d hit"
msgid_plural "%d hits"
msgstr[0] "%d correspondance"
msgstr[1] "%d correspondances"

#: admin/views/sections/firewall.php:273
msgid "monitor"
msgstr "surveillance"

#: admin/views/sidebar/overview.php:33
msgid "enforces strong, unique passwords and blocks breached ones."
msgstr ""
"impose des mots de passe forts et uniques, et bloque ceux qui ont fuité."

#: admin/views/sidebar/overview.php:34
msgid "idle timeout, maximum session lifetime, single-device login."
msgstr ""
"expiration pour inactivité, durée de vie maximale de session, connexion sur "
"un seul appareil."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:86
msgid "enforce a minimum character count on new and changed passwords."
msgstr ""
"imposez un nombre minimal de caractères sur les mots de passe nouveaux ou "
"modifiés."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:87
msgid "Complexity"
msgstr "Complexité"

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:87
msgid "require lower/upper case, a number, and optionally a symbol."
msgstr ""
"exigez des minuscules/majuscules, un chiffre et, en option, un symbole."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:88
msgid "Block compromised"
msgstr "Blocage des compromis"

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:88
msgid ""
"reject passwords found in public breaches. The password never leaves your "
"server (Have I Been Pwned k-anonymity)."
msgstr ""
"rejette les mots de passe trouvés dans des fuites publiques. Le mot de passe"
" ne quitte jamais votre serveur (k-anonymat Have I Been Pwned)."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:89
msgid "Expiration"
msgstr "Expiration"

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:89
msgid "optionally force a reset after N days. 0 = never expires."
msgstr ""
"forcez en option une réinitialisation après N jours. 0 = n’expire jamais."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:90
msgid ""
"applies at registration, profile update and password reset. Fails soft if "
"the breach API is unreachable."
msgstr ""
"s’applique à l’inscription, à la mise à jour du profil et à la "
"réinitialisation du mot de passe. Échoue en douceur si l’API de fuites est "
"injoignable."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:97
msgid "sign out accounts after a period of inactivity. 0 = off."
msgstr "déconnecte les comptes après une période d’inactivité. 0 = désactivé."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:98
msgid "Max lifetime"
msgstr "Durée de vie maximale"

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:98
msgid "cap how long a session stays valid regardless of activity."
msgstr ""
"limite la durée de validité d’une session, quelle que soit l’activité."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:99
msgid "Single session"
msgstr "Session unique"

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:99
msgid ""
"one active device per account; logging in elsewhere ends the older session."
msgstr ""
"un seul appareil actif par compte ; se connecter ailleurs met fin à la "
"session la plus ancienne."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:100
msgid "Sign out others"
msgstr "Déconnecter les autres"

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:100
msgid "end every other session for your own account from your profile."
msgstr ""
"mettez fin à toutes les autres sessions de votre compte depuis votre profil."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:106
msgid ""
"Shows the country of origin next to IP addresses in Incidents and Events. "
"Lookups use the keyless ipwho.is service, are cached, and never affect the "
"security score. Purely informational."
msgstr ""
"Affiche le pays d’origine à côté des adresses IP dans les Incidents et les "
"Évènements. Les recherches utilisent le service ipwho.is sans clé, sont "
"mises en cache et n’affectent jamais le score de sécurité. Purement "
"informatif."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:112
msgid "logs would-be blocks as incidents without blocking. Always start here."
msgstr ""
"journalise les blocages potentiels en incidents sans rien bloquer. Commencez"
" toujours par là."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:113
msgid ""
"actually blocks matching requests with a 403. Switch once the monitor log "
"looks clean."
msgstr ""
"bloque réellement les requêtes correspondantes avec une erreur 403. Basculez"
" une fois que le journal de surveillance est propre."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:114
msgid ""
"bad query strings, paths and HTTP methods. Very low false-positive risk; on "
"by default."
msgstr ""
"mauvaises chaînes de requête, chemins et méthodes HTTP. Risque de faux "
"positifs très faible ; activé par défaut."

#: admin/views/sidebar/settings.php:115
msgid ""
"user-agent and referrer filtering, XML-RPC and author probes. Higher false-"
